{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Welcome to Amato!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a forest spirit able to possess objects and guide kokedamas \u2014 small endangered plant spheres \u2014 to fertile lands! Tilt the environment, master gravity, and protect nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A blend of puzzles and precision challenges</strong><br>Switch between exploration phases with clever environmental puzzles and skill-based courses where agility and timing are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f<strong>A vibrant, evolving world</strong><br>Use weather effects, physics, and biome-specific mechanics to overcome obstacles and unravel the forest\u2019s mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A colorful and relaxing atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a cozy universe inspired by traditional Japan, with warm visuals and a smooth, jazzy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f<strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong><br>Easy to pick up, but offering real challenges for players who seek perfect mastery of every course!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/extras/schema_fleur.png?t=1746038713\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698590?t=1746038713","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698590?t=1746038713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/bd427cca3b72f34d93bd3a208b728e8c1738dee7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746038713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/bd427cca3b72f34d93bd3a208b728e8c1738dee7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746038713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing